  "description": "Protocol-agnostic message validation pipeline for .NET — deserialize, validate, and dispatch messages from RabbitMQ, Kafka, MQTT, Azure Service Bus, NATS, or any messaging transport. Features DI integration, dead-letter support, pluggable validators (FluentValidation, DataAnnotations, ONNX edge-AI models), configurable failure handling, and OpenTelemetry-compatible metrics.",
